      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-df7b485f-d2de-46d1-a734-8ae0f799ef8e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:800px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-df7b485f-d2de-46d1-a734-8ae0f799ef8e\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTExMDdfMTEg/MDAxNzYyNDg2MDQ4ODg1.30pgBV26Da_200MuZWhz3a83UfgbP3X3lSWph0c-p_cg.zvJIrQ0cuD6PGTahEqJxGu8Y1XT7mpRSg9efw5vfIBcg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_800x236.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"800\", \"originalHeight\" : \"236\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTExMDdfMTEg/MDAxNzYyNDg2MDQ4ODg1.30pgBV26Da_200MuZWhz3a83UfgbP3X3lSWph0c-p_cg.zvJIrQ0cuD6PGTahEqJxGu8Y1XT7mpRSg9efw5vfIBcg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_800x236.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-df7b485f-d2de-46d1-a734-8ae0f799ef8e\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ec9e6698-46b7-4999-9d96-48430fc480fe\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-16d94216-5714-4c93-85d0-9ab61093c9f2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8ed2957b-d1b2-49e9-832d-82d6c2253f62\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-64bed069-3211-4c9b-94a7-4c86fc3e5a33\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b81ee57e-346d-4584-a547-d3d8d658e895\">입니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7e81fa10-4fad-4bf0-be93-28bdae3d6019\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e55ab491-8a2f-4e2a-8cdc-b880f44a5767\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7be6954f-792a-4ecc-8650-212159e6cd3d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-91ed24e9-42cc-4273-b1ba-697217e9d48f\">​11/7(금) 11:30 ~ 13:30 경에</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-05726150-f6ec-4d97-83eb-654ee8e1dd19\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-857cc82a-d7b2-4245-a6ff-0be08ecc1284\">무점검 업데이트가 진행되었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e72b314d-0599-4320-b2ea-509bdc13e9f1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c2d03e0a-6d3a-4aa7-a5f0-1ce628305339\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c411a39e-edcd-48b9-bcfa-240e64d53af8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4b5182e1-a4c6-440e-91a2-26f27fef9370\">​게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e116f00a-570f-4532-a72b-2cb698ec8c93\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-69703e90-6c42-434d-ba5e-73572622c067\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f1c678b-247a-42c7-bc7c-e380ed713db0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2a4b7d70-c626-4b6e-bde0-c6037f84e63f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dabe217e-62f2-441a-99b0-c6e752d05710\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d3558602-ca30-4637-b50b-489209464478\">​​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-105ae38a-0002-4dfd-bf87-c2dd75ecc594\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-00e91ba5-9708-43ab-91cc-95a9e9a5d091\"><b>📢 11/7(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-272d889d-a418-4b66-942c-46aeab26cbff\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-432897b8-648d-4630-acd6-670fa0e0d11c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d6b402f-5284-4739-8102-2e277a0e274a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c26cb4e0-58fa-474c-beda-0f1758650242\"><b>​​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-54caf2c1-c5ec-413d-ab0a-d279664a0b44\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-af7b92b2-6794-4d8a-b8ff-4bfb49ca02d7\">- 11/7(금) 11:30 ~ 13:30 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-066ddedf-0d0d-44fa-baa1-509727d27074\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6ebe24e4-b489-4fbf-b4ec-41f813656a4c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4f60a1a2-cd88-4ac4-b90c-55bc984cb479\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e8844708-9b14-471a-b3fb-937923691178\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce21c3a2-d572-4563-9d2d-d96af3b7360a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-167dad6b-5d67-43c8-8bce-5fe4d967fa44\">1. 특정 상황에서 지상의 보물 상자를 획득 할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-46b50056-a36f-44f9-8eba-cff00a65ea09\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-288f648b-85a1-4359-a158-5ba2153ba66c\">2. 특정 상황에서 지상 내 회복 중인 스쿼드가 점령지 외부에 위치할 경우, 해당 스쿼드를 조작할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-188f4be2-2aa7-4e53-8d77-efe357a1c321\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-766ccf60-4ff2-4ab3-aabe-e2d6bd02f13f\">└ 해당 현상이 발생한 경우, 지상을 종료하신 뒤 다시 진입하여 주시길 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e99f680-e83f-4881-b9fb-de177319c6ab\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e78ade47-a503-471c-87c3-c5ef60f628b7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-18d4fd5d-170e-4aa1-aed8-9ac00c83ec38\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cf17185a-8ebd-434a-ad6d-448c0d7ad4fd\">​​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57c9eb1a-d6ee-4c49-9a10-21e55bf18624\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c71bb48b-0198-4763-94c7-ee3da652f9ad\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d49fd4c-2a38-4c51-b1b6-47739e85e21c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-641c2aed-c687-4fd9-9c26-2fe9ccb1ecf6\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-17fe68a2-fa1d-40f4-b650-ac6f27b44f7a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05a9c9df-2c7c-4ef1-aaa2-0492793d3eaa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7474e540-a561-42a6-bb16-fa9d632466a9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cbdc211a-33b8-46c4-84b9-641450d780bf\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        <